cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (via this Zenodo DOI) and the associated paper."
title: "scRNAseq Hodge Decomposition Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Generalised single-cell RNA-seq analysis pipeline using discrete Hodge
  decomposition on SPD/log-Euclidean covariance manifolds to identify
  upstream cell types and upstream genes driving disease- or
  condition-associated changes in gene co-expression structure.
  Developed for ALS/FTLD research and validated against external
  perturbation benchmarks (Norman 2019 Perturb-seq, Shen 2024 CRISPR,
  TimeVault PC9, TCGA+GTEx glioma, Mendelian randomization).
type: software
